      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So you want to delete the option that shows only the icon or in the current live version the first three letters, what about the option to hide nameplates entirely? Interestingly enough I've seen people want to hide pronouns as they're not often actually pronouns.\n\nIn a more serious response you should try out the open beta, there are changes to the name tag stuffs and people have been sharing feedback both under the feature request, but mostly under the open beta focused category.",
