  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "in a way this is kind of personal but i think it will help others as well.\n\nin vrchat you can hide the usernames of people and by hide i mean show only the first 2 letters or 3 of the original username, i think this option should be deleted as someone like me who uses a Ram (the animal) as a way to present my self is often mistaken for a goat, which gets annyoing at times, on my status and as well on my pronouns it says \"not a goat\" and \"sheep/ram\", but to many have this option enabled where they cant see the names at all unless they open up their menu, meaning most people do not see who they talk to, what to call them, how to call them and so on.",
